EconLogic-BSQA NOTICE

EconLogic-BSQA is a derivative benchmark constructed from EconLogicQA. The
name "EconLogic-BSQA" is used to indicate dataset lineage and task
transformation. It does not imply affiliation with, sponsorship by, or
endorsement from the original EconLogicQA authors.

