Modification notice:
EconLogic-BSQA transforms source event-ordering items into closed-world
business belief-sufficiency QA instances with abstracted entities, local rules,
controlled evidence conditions, gold sufficiency labels, and A-D decision
choices. The transformed dataset is not the original EconLogicQA dataset.

Raw source-data access:
Raw EconLogicQA files should be obtained from the original release and used
according to the original dataset license and terms.
